# Activity Browser — core invariants

- Read `AGENTS.md` and use vocabulary from `CONTEXT.md`.
- Placement: Brightway-only → `bwutils/`; app-agnostic widgets → `ui/`; app-aware pages/panes/actions → `app/`.
- Domain updates: user → action → Brightway/bwutils → bw signals → `app.signals` → UI (see `docs/adr/0003-signals-event-bus.md`). UI listens; do not emit domain signals from UI to refresh other UI.
- Preserve deferred-import patterns on hot paths (`ADR-0002`).
- Do not invent or harden a plugin API (placeholder in `AGENTS.md` until redesigned).
- Prefer small, localized diffs; add/update tests for stateful behavior.
